'''The Angel & The Demon''' (天使と般若, ''Tenshi to Han'nya'', '''Angel and Hannya''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 3 Legend [[Catseye]]s as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[No Plan A (Deadly)|No Plan A]] and [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]] respectively. To unlock The Angel & The Demon, you must clear both Clionel Ascendant and River Styx.

